    "^(in today'?s|in a world where|in an era|in the ever|are you (tired|looking|ready|struggling)|have you ever (wondered|felt|thought)|let'?s (talk|dive|explore|face it)|when it comes to|picture this|imagine|did you know|ever wondered|we all know|it'?s no secret|there'?s no denying|in the (fast|digital|modern)|welcome to|hello,? (everyone|friends)|hey (there|everyone|friends|guys)|hi (there|everyone|all|guys|friends)|today,? (we'?re|we are|i'?m|i am) (going to|gonna) (talk|look|discuss|cover|dive)|in this (video|post|article|blog|guide|thread))"
